## AgySafe delegation

For explicit AgySafe / AGY / Antigravity requests, use the local terminal command:

```text
agysafe --workspace "." --json "<exact user task>"
```

Default model and mode are automatic. Respect explicit `--model` or `--mode` requests.
Return the actual AgySafe result and do not silently retry long failures.
<!-- AGYSAFE:END -->
